distorted woman.  She appears to be clad in tattered rags and covered in a
layer of dust and dirt.  As she stands up to face you her eyes appear to be
missing, leaving nothing but empty sockets.  However, upon closer examination
you can finally make out her eyes, which are completely black with no visible
iris.    
~
